{"html": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/928840/extras/f5d2b8c328e927869f940bd18e079b51.avif?t=1758798070\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br><br>Cybarian The Tme Travelling Warrior is a classically inspired arcade action game, with a mixture of modern and retro gaming tropes.<br><br>The game is an amalgamation of old school 2d platformers and side scrolling beat em’ ups.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautifully animated and expertly realised retro style pixel art.<br><br></li><li>Epic boss battles! Expand your abilities!<br><br></li><li>Explosive and engaging combat!<br><br></li><li>Classic platforming.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/928840/extras/4e75a104393bb2d1f63ca0a37078720d.avif?t=1758798070\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/928840/extras/213b356dbec2abed10e79469aab623ee.avif?t=1758798070\" width=600 height=335 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/928840/extras/63370069e99b97d3c87eb2165ad45c7a.avif?t=1758798070\" width=600 height=334 /></span>"}